    "Stat slides have image none because stat backgrounds are automatic.",
    "Luna comparison slide image none: benchmark comparison is an idea with nothing physical to show.",
    "Sonnet slide image none: benchmark comparison, nothing physical to show.",
    "Closing slide image none: pricing and missing independent tests, nothing physical to show.",
    "Anthropic's logo used on slide 2 only, plus the cover logo card.",
    "Left out the Kingy leaderboard figure (Sonnet 5.5 at 61.8% vs Anthropic's 70.6%) to keep slides tight; the Sonnet slide attributes the 70.6% to Anthropic's table.",
    "The 75% slide attributes the figure to Anthropic and presents The Decoder's caution as a separate view, since Anthropic says its figure already counts the tokenizer change.",
    "Luna's same-price claim and the strict OSWorld pass rates are single-source Kingy AI readings, attributed on the slides.",
    "Omitted Max/Team API credits and most customer claims to avoid padding; the arc ends on the pricing war and unverified scores."
  ]
}

